The reimplementation in `lib/argument.js` is complete:
- Constructor parses `<name>`/`[name]`/bare/`...` syntax and stores the bare name in `_name` with `variadic`/`required` flags.
- `name()` returns the bare name; `default()`, `argParser()`, `choices()`, `argRequired()`, `argOptional()` all return `this`.
