{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787414080073,"sessionID":"ses_fd5d2b705ffeknIDebNDUjPyzF","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-b855788bae05413280d943233ca8ef05","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"const maxDistance = 3;

/**
 * Restricted Damerau-Levenshtein distance: counts insertion, deletion,
 * substitution, and transposition of two adjacent characters as a single edit.
 *
 * @param {string} a
 * @param {string} b
 * @returns {number}
 */

function editDistance(a, b) {
  const lenA = a.length;
  const lenB = b.length;

  if (lenA === 0) return lenB;
  if (lenB === 0) return lenA;

  let prevPrev = null;
  let prev = Array.from({ length: lenB + 1 }, (_, j) => j);

  for (let i = 1; i <= lenA; i++) {
    const curr = new Array(lenB + 1);
    curr[0] = i;
    for (let j = 1; j <= lenB; j++) {
      const cost = a[i - 1] === b[j - 1] ? 0 : 1;
      let val = Math.min(
        prev[j] + 1,
        curr[j - 1] + 1,
        prev[j - 1] + cost,
      );
      if (i > 1 && j > 1 && a[i - 1] === b[j - 2] && a[i - 2] === b[j - 1]) {
        val = Math.min(val, prevPrev[j - 2] + 1);
      }
      curr[j] = val;
    }
    prevPrev = prev;
    prev = curr;
  }

  return prev[lenB];
}

/**
 * Find close matches using edit distance similarity.
 *
 * @param {string} word
 * @param {string[]} candidates
 * @returns {string}
 */

export function suggestSimilar(word, candidates) {
  if (!candidates || candidates.length === 0) return '';

  const searchingOptions = word.startsWith('--');
  const prefix = searchingOptions ? '--' : '';
  const target = searchingOptions ? word.slice(2) : word;

  let bestDistance = Infinity;
  let best = [];
  const seen = new Set();

  for (const candidate of candidates) {
    const candCompare = searchingOptions && candidate.startsWith('--')
      ? candidate.slice(2)
      : candidate;

    if (seen.has(candCompare)) continue;
    seen.add(candCompare);

    if (candCompare.length <= 1) continue;

    const distance = editDistance(target, candCompare);
    if (distance > maxDistance) continue;

    const longer = Math.max(target.length, candCompare.length);
    const similarity = (longer - distance) / longer;
    if (similarity <= 0.4) continue;

    if (distance < bestDistance) {
      bestDistance = distance;
      best = [candCompare];
    } else if (distance === bestDistance) {
      best.push(candCompare);
    }
  }

  if (best.length === 0) return '';

  best.sort((a, b) => a.localeCompare(b));

  const output = best.map((c) => `${prefix}${c}`);

  if (output.length === 1) {
    return `\n(Did you mean ${output[0]}?)`;
  }
  return `\n(Did you mean one of ${output.join(', ')}?)`;
}
